* AVOID DUPLICATES
    PERFORM duplicados.
* Check that no material is included in another inventory
    LOOP AT datos.
      TRANSLATE datos-werks TO UPPER CASE.
      TRANSLATE datos-lgort TO UPPER CASE.
* Check whether the material exists
      SELECT SINGLE * FROM mara
          WHERE matnr = datos-matnr.

      IF sy-subrc NE 0.
